@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/labels

### List labels
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Get a label by id (INBOX always exists; use an id from the list for your own labels)
GET {{baseUrl}}/INBOX

### Get a label that doesn't exist (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/not-a-real-id

### Create a label (expect 201; run it twice to see 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "API test label" }

### Create with a blank name (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": " " }
